### 1. Create a user; copy token and id from response
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo investor"}

### Replace TOKEN and PORTFOLIO_ID using previous responses
POST http://localhost:3000/portfolios
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"horizon":2}

### Fund simulated cash
POST http://localhost:3000/portfolios/PORTFOLIO_ID/funds
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: initial-funds
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":"10000.00"}

### Queue one buy
POST http://localhost:3000/portfolios/PORTFOLIO_ID/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: first-order
Content-Type: application/json

{"symbol":"AAPL","side":"BUY","quantity":3}

### Execute; replace ORDER_ID
POST http://localhost:3000/portfolios/PORTFOLIO_ID/orders/ORDER_ID/execute
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: first-fill

### Analyze: riskYears is historical window, horizon is investment goal
POST http://localhost:3000/portfolios/PORTFOLIO_ID/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"symbols":["AAPL","MSFT","AMZN","GOOGL","META"],"cutoff":"2025-10-16","horizon":2,"riskYears":5}

### Inspect current state
GET http://localhost:3000/portfolios/PORTFOLIO_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
